    "updated_at": "2024-06-14T04:47:32Z",
    "body": "> do you have a fuller example of what you're trying to accomplish and how the current api falls short?\r\n\r\nI wanted to fetch out a range of values from [Storage](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Storage) interface. For example get me all values in between `fruit-apple` and `fruit-orange`.\r\nOne can't do that with the current Storage interface as it allows only pulling out single value using `getItem`.\r\n\r\nSo I suggest we should have a feature to pull out range of values out of Storage interface.",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
